{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":493817,"name":"6tizer","username":"6tizer","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/6/bc8723/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-17T10:53:57.412Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493817-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493817-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493817-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493817-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne specific Grok Bot (Chief of Staff) stopped responding. Other bots on the same Agent Computer still work (e.g. CIO replies). A duplicate/copy of Chief of Staff can talk normally, but has no original history.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease restart ONLY this bot’s runner. Do NOT Reset / rebuild / Update the Agent Computer. Do NOT delete the bot. Conversation history must remain on the original bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBot name: Chief of Staff\u003cbr\u003e\nAgent ID: aa282b9f-96e4-47c4-811d-f5ff1bcbdd95\u003cbr\u003e\nSidebar serverId: 1735822\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlready tried: short messages, Cmd-K, Update shows computer already latest (Grok Bot 0.55.0 stable), pings from another bot. Not an account-wide usage-cap pattern because other bots and the copy still reply.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSame pattern as: \u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-one-bot-silent-after-image-gen-restart-this-bots-runner-only-do-not-reset/171840\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eGrok Bot: one bot silent after image_gen — restart this bot's runner only, do NOT Reset\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHard requirements:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRestart this bot’s runner only\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDo NOT Reset / rebuild / Update the Agent Computer\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDo NOT delete the bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHistory must stay on the original bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493817-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493817-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSend a short message to the original Chief of Staff Grok Bot; it does not respond. Other bots on the same Agent Computer still reply, and a duplicate/copy of Chief of Staff responds normally.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493817-operating-system-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493817-operating-system-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOther\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493817-version-information-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493817-version-information-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot 0.55.0 stable (Update reports the Agent Computer is already latest)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493817-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493817-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-17T11:03:03.501Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":24,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":121.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":172005,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-one-bot-chief-of-staff-silent-copy-works-please-restart-this-bots-runner-only-do-not-reset","display_username":"6tizer","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"ve